Mission64Desc=There is a reason the safe settlement are able to remain safe, and that is constant upkeep by survivors like yourself.  The Goblin Peak safe settlement is in need of more food.\n\nDeliver 5 bags of Chips to the Goblin Peak safe settlement, and receive a reward for your efforts.
