Mission70=БОНУС: Демилитаризация Castle Pine
Mission70Desc=Если бы зомби не были основной проблемой, люди бы передрались между собой за остатки оружия. Безопасные поселения предлагают мирным людям отдать свое оружие и получить взамен товары первой необходимости.\n\nСдайте 1 снайперскую винтовку M107 в безопасном поселении Castle Pine и получите награду за свои старания.
Mission71=Survivalist Outpost Supplies: Water
Mission71Desc=There is a reason the safe settlement are able to remain safe, and that is constant upkeep by survivors like yourself.  The Survivalist Outpost safe settlement is in need of clean drinking water.\n\nDeliver 5 bottles of 375ml Water to the Survivalist Outpost safe settlement, and receive a reward for your efforts.
Mission72=Survivalist Outpost Supplies: Food
Mission72Desc=There is a reason the safe settlement are able to remain safe, and that is constant upkeep by survivors like yourself.  The Survivalist Outpost safe settlement is in need of more food.\n\nDeliver 5 bags of Chips to the Survivalist Outpost safe settlement, and receive a reward for your efforts.
Mission73=Survivalist Outpost Supplies: Bandages
Mission73Desc=There is a reason the safe settlement are able to remain safe, and that is constant upkeep by survivors like yourself.  The Survivalist Outpost safe settlement is in need of more bandages.\n\nDeliver 5 bandages to the Survivalist Outpost safe settlement, and receive a reward for your efforts.
Mission74=БОНУС: Демилитар-ия Survivalist Outpost
Mission74Desc=Если бы зомби не были основной проблемой, люди бы передрались между собой за остатки оружия. Безопасные поселения предлагают мирным людям отдать свое оружие и получить взамен товары первой необходимости.\n\nСдайте 1 штурмовую винтовку SIG Sauer 556 в безопасном поселении Survivalist Outpost и получите награду за свои старания.
Mission75=Оружейных дел мастер: Голые руки
Mission75Desc=Думаете, вы могли бы стать мастером школы "Летящего кулака"?\n\nДокажите, что вы достойны, убив 20 зомби голыми руками.
Mission76=Оружейных дел мастер: Холодное оружие
Mission76Desc=Любой уличный болван сможет стрелять по зомби, но не каждый сможет отбиться от них врукопашную.\n\nДокажите свое мастерство, убив 20 зомби холодным оружием.
Mission77=Оружейных дел мастер: Пистолеты
Mission77Desc=Эй, амиго? Готов показать, как управляться с пистольеро? \n\nДокажите свое мастерство, убив 20 зомби из пистолетов.
Mission78=Оружейных дел мастер: Дробовики
Mission78Desc=Настало время отвести угрозу хорошими порциями свинцовой дроби!  \n\nДокажите свое мастерство, убив 20 зомби из дробовиков.
Mission79=Оружейных дел мастер: Пистолеты-пулемёты
Mission79Desc=Нашпигуйте головы зомби свинцовыми штуками с близкой дистанции!\n\nУбейте 20 зомби из пистолетов-пулемётов.
Mission80=Оружейных дел мастер: Пулемёты
Mission80Desc=Тра-та-та-та-та на сундук мертвеца! Зачем делать несколько выстрелов, если можно залить всё свинцом?\n\nУбейте 20 зомби из пулемётов.
Mission81=Оружейных дел мастер: Штурмовые винтовки
Mission81Desc=Автомат, полуавтомат или одиночный? Выберите свой стиль и защищайте окружающую среду! \n\nУбейте 20 зомби из штурмовых винтовок.
Mission82=Оружейных дел мастер: Снайперские винтовки
Mission82Desc=Зачем подвергать себя риску вблизи? Пора попрактиковаться на полуживых подвижных целях \n\nУбейте 20 зомби из снайперских винтовок.
Mission83=Оружейных дел мастер: Гранаты
Mission83Desc=Зомби бегут на любой источник звука. Дайте им послушать музыку взрыва ваших гранат! \n\nУбейте 20 зомби гранатами.
Mission84=Найдите Wooden Barricade
Mission84Desc=The tree's have more use then just being paper. Have to find a way to sturdy my defense using them.\n\nПолучите 1 Wooden Barricade. 
Mission85=Найдите Antibiotics
Mission85Desc=Feeling really sick. A little woozy now.  If only there was something i could take. The infection is starting to get worse.\n\nПолучите 1 Antibiotic.
Mission86=Найдите Bandages
Mission86Desc=Sliced my hand open and now i'm bleeding all over the place. If only i had something to wrap this.\n\nПолучите 1 Bandage. 
Mission87=Найдите Bandages DX
Mission87Desc=It's a gusher. Didnt have a choice had to run through the barb wire. Going to need more then your standard Bandage.\n\nПолучите 1 Bandages DX
Mission88=Найдите Pain Killers
Mission88Desc=It aches all over my body. That was a long fall. Feeling so numb and slowing down. Need something to hold me over and fight through the pain till i can reach safety.\n\nПолучите 1 container of Pain Killers.
Mission89=Найдите Medkit
Mission89Desc=Going to need a lot for this trip. I can only imagine that there is a lot of pain in my future. Going to need something that can keep me extremely healthy. Must stay on my toe's.\n\nПолучите 1 Medkit.
Mission90=Найдите Bag of Chips
Mission90Desc=Crunchy, salty, flavorful bags of baked potatoe goodness. It can only remind me of the good old days when running constanlty wasn't neccesary. So hungry.\n\nПолучите 1 Bag of Chips
Mission91=Найдите Instant Oatmeal
Mission91Desc=Opening that box, pulling out the packet, and shaking it. Pouring the contents in the lilttle paper baggy into the bowl and adding hot water. Breakfast is served.\n\nПолучите 1 Instant Oatmeal.
Mission92=Найдите Chocolate Bar
Mission92Desc=Nothing satisfies your hunger like an aged chocolate bar found on the ground near a pile of zombie carcasses. Don't be such a diva...you would be surprised at what man can eat when in desparate times. \n\nПолучите 1 Chocolate Bar
Mission93=Найдите Granola Bar
Mission93Desc=It ain't a steak but at least it ain't grubworms! Besides, granola is supposed to be old and dry. Make sure you have some water to wash it down.\n\nПолучите 1 Granola Bar
Mission94=Найдите Can of Tuna
Mission94Desc=It isn't a chicken or a fish...it's all you got left in the cupboard and by golly, you will eat every last bit of it to survive. \n\nПолучите 1 Can of Tuna
Mission95=Найдите MiniSaints
Mission95Desc=Care for an expired pack of two-stick donutty goodness? Well what are you waiting for? Grab some MiniSaints and cross your fingers there aren't creepy crawlers inside.\n\nПолучите 1 pack of MiniSaints 
Mission96=Найдите Coconut Water
Mission96Desc=Well, we won't be taking any tropical getaways anytime soon. Closest thing we have to a tropical island getaway is the delicious refreshing taste of Coconut Water. \n\nПолучите 1 Coconut Water
Mission97=Найдите Energy Drink
Mission97Desc=Killing zombies and looting takes a lot out of you. \n\nПолучите 1 Energy Drink
Mission98=Найдите Electro-AID
Mission98Desc=Running from zombies and other humans can take it's toll on your body. Make sure you maximize your potential with Electro-Aid and keep your engine firing on all cylinders! \n\nПолучите 1 Electro-Aid
Mission99=Найдите Can of Soda
Mission99Desc=Makes perfect sense to drink a random can of cola found in an abandoned store or restaraunt. I mean, it is only corrosive if you leave something in it. Drinking it is fine, right? \n\nНайдите a Can of Soda
Mission100=Найдите Juice
Mission100Desc=Drink it while you can. There are zero fruit trees around and no supply trucks coming into any of the safe zones. Who would have thought Juice would have hit the black market?\n\nНайдите a bottle of Juice
Mission101=Найдите Water 1L
Mission101Desc=Plan for a journey, pack for survival. Make sure that you have enough Water to hydrate yourself when your thirst and stamina get low. You will need to be combat ready at all times. \n\nНайдите Water 1L
Mission102=Найдите Water 375ml
Mission102Desc=Plan for a journey, pack for survival. Make sure that you have enough Water to hydrate yourself when your thirst and stamina get low. You will need to be combat ready at all times. \n\nНайдите Water 375ML
Mission103=Найдите Can of Pasta
Mission103Desc=My noodle has a first name, it's E X P I R E D! In these trying times, beggars cannot be choosey. Slurp that noodle like it was your last! \n\nНайдите a Can of Pasta
Mission104=Найдите Can of Soup
Mission104Desc=No bowls, spoons or even crackers. Just a straight up can of soup. Almost like mom used to prepare for you only slightly passed it's expiration date. Better than dying of starvation and turning into one of those...things. \n\nНайдите a Can of Soup 
Mission105=Найдите Can of Ham
Mission105Desc=Time to go Hard As a Mother, and find some real food.  None of that soupy stuff, or sugary snacks.  You need to find yourself some HAM.\n\nПолучите 1 Can of Ham.
Mission106=Найдите Bag MRE
Mission106Desc=If it's good enough for a soldier it is good enough for me. Satisfying my every need and giving me the strength to go on. This is the meal of choice for a one man army.\n\nПолучите 1 Bag MRE
Mission107=Найдите C01-Vaccine
Mission107Desc=With all these zombies around it is only a matter of time before you, or someone you care about, will get infected.  If you do not react quickly, the infection will spread and kill the host.  With a vaccine you can slow or even stop the process.\n\nПолучите 1 C01-Vaccine.
Mission108=Найдите C04-Vaccine
Mission108Desc=With all these zombies around it is only a matter of time before you, or someone you care about, will get infected.  If you do not react quickly, the infection will spread and kill the host.  With a vaccine you can slow or even stop the process.\n\nПолучите 1 C04-Vaccine.
Mission109=Найдите Barb Wire Barricade
Mission109Desc=You may not be able to stop them, but you can sure as hell slow them down with a barbed wire barricade, so stock up.\n\nПолучите 1 Barb Ware Barricade.
Mission110=Найдите Riot Shield
Mission110Desc=When you are stuck inside a building and surrounded by zombies, a good riot shield can mean the difference between life an death.\n\nПолучите 1 Riot Shield
Mission111=Найдите Sandbag Barricade
Mission111Desc=You may not be able to stop them, but you can sure as hell slow them down with a sandbag barricade, so stock up.\n\nПолучите 1 Sandbag Barricade.
Mission112=Найдите Flare
Mission112Desc=Flares are spectacualr for eluminating dark areas, and revealing enemies in the dark.  They are also great tools for luring zombies away from your desired path.\n\nНайдите 1 Flare.
Mission113=Найдите Chemlight White
Mission113Desc=Одному в темноте тут жутковато. Видеть бы хоть что-нибудь в паре метров впереди.... \n\nПолучите 1 Chemlight White.
Mission114=Найдите Chemlight Green
Mission114Desc=Одному в темноте тут жутковато. Видеть бы хоть что-нибудь в паре метров впереди.... \n\nПолучите 1 Chemlight Green.
