Mission175=Найдите Arrow
Mission175Desc=While one of the most primative forms of balistics, the arrow is also one of the most effective with great power and accuracy.\n\nПолучите 1 Arrow.
Mission176=Найдите VSS-20
Mission176Desc=Ammunition for one of the most valued weapons among survivors, the VSS has the best of both long and short range worlds.  Due to its popularity, survivors are eager to find all the ammunition they can for the weapon.\n\nПолучите 1 VSS-20
Mission177=Найдите Tactical Knife
Mission177Desc=Feeling stabby? Locate yourself a Tactical Knife to scratch that itch! On a side note, you might find use for this weapon in "craftier" ways.\n\nНайдите a Tactical Knife
Mission178=Найдите Bat
Mission178Desc=Remember watching baseball as kid and seeing your favorite player knock one out of the park? That sweet smell of beer and hot dogs throughout the stadium filling your nasal passage and penetrating straight to all the right senses still tickles the souls of baseball fans. Ain't gonna let a few zombies stop you from enjoying the great American past time are you?\n\nНайдите a bat swing away! 
Mission179=Найдите Flashlight
Mission179Desc=Even as starting item, the flashlight has been hailed as one of the finest utilities in the survivors repertoire.\n\nПолучите 1 Flashlight.
Mission180=Найдите Hammer
Mission180Desc=Whether you are boarding up windows or just trying to stay alive, the Hammer is a great multipurpose tool for all your zombie dispensing neeeds. Lightweight but heavy duty, this little mama will put a hurtin' on an enemy without any remorse. \n\nНайдите a Hammer. Might want to check construction sites...workers have zero use since they became lunch for the zeddies! 
Mission181=Найдите Hatchet
Mission181Desc=Here's Jonny!  Hack your way through enemies with a good ol' fashion hatchet, and strike fear in their hearts.  Or just strike your enemy's hearts, they will die much faster.\n\nПолучите 1 Hatchet.
Mission182=Найдите Pickaxe
Mission182Desc=Pickaxes have been used for quite some time for agriculture, mining and even in combat. During preshistoric times, a pickaxe may have been made from the filed down bones and antlers of a large deer. Now a bit more sturdy and less organic, this weapon will save your ass in battle if you run out of ammo and go toe to toe with zombies or even other survivors. \n\nWant that rugged coal miner look without the carbon minoxide? \n\nНайдите yourself a Pickaxe and start chipping away at some skulls. 
Mission183=Найдите Spiked Bat
Mission183Desc=Behold the next level of weaponized bats with the new and improved Spiked Bat, now with more spikes!\n\nПолучите 1 Spiked Bat.
Mission184=Найдите Metal Bat
Mission184Desc=Swing away. Just don't swing so hard you knock yourself out. You will find out first hand how the other half lives...or semi-lives I should say. \n\nНайдите a Metal Bat
Mission185=Найдите Katana
Mission185Desc=And ancient weapon, used in combat for many generations in Japan, now replicated by the thousands in cheap sweatshops.  Ironic?\n\nПолучите 1 Katana.
Mission186=Найдите Machete
Mission186Desc=Whether it's hacking through vines, shrubbery or corpses, the Machete is a symbol of bad-assery in every facet of the made-up word just used to describe it. Always remember to target the head. The body cannot move without the brain. Severe the connection to the brain and it's curtains for you ZOMBIE!\n\nНайдите a Machete 
Mission187=Найдите Brass Knuckles
Mission187Desc=It is amazing how much more damage you can do with a single punch when you add a little metal into the mix.\n\nПолучите 1 Brass Knuckles
Mission188=Найдите Canoe Paddle
Mission188Desc=Not a lot has to be said about this fantastic item, its value, and importance in the history of The Brotherhood and its supporters.\n\nПолучите 1 Canoe Paddle, the hand of the one true god.
Mission189=Найдите Cricket bat
Mission189Desc=A popular item used in the sport of Cricket, and in the business of dispensing zombies.\n\nПолучите 1 Cricket Bat.
Mission190=Найдите Shovel
Mission190Desc=The perfect murder weapon.  Can be used for both bludgeoning your enemy and burrying him afterwords.\n\nПолучите 1 Shovel.
Mission191=Найдите Crowbar
Mission191Desc=You are not truely a free man until you have found and wielded a Crowbar.  Heck, I have even seen it used successfully against transdimentional aliend invaders.\n\nПолучите 1 Crowbar.
Mission192=Найдите Fire Axe
Mission192Desc=Do not be fooled, this weapon is not infact made of fire, nore does it actually help to put out fire.  But it is hand for all other axe related activities.\n\nПолучите 1 Fire Axe.
Mission193=Найдите Pitchfork
Mission193Desc=PItchforks were created to effectively move hay and other straw grass with much greater ease than a shovel or rake.  In recent years it has been discovered to be equally effective against attacking and killing zombies.\n\nПолучите 1 Pitchfork.
Mission194=Найдите Wrench
Mission194Desc=This item can be used to fix dosens of different things, but when thrown into something can also be the cause of disaray.\n\nПолучите 1 Wrench.
