Mission234=Найдите Honey Badger
Mission234Desc=This is the Honey Badger, watching it fire in slow motion.  "Watch out"" says that survivor, eww it can kill snakes.  It's just crazy.  I will kill anything.  I doesn't care.  Now look, here is a house full of zombies, watch how the Honey Badger just shoots through the zombies.\n\nПолучите 1 Honey Badger
Mission235=Найдите FN P90
Mission235Desc=Fierce and fast, the FN-P90 is a particularly lethal firearm especially from mid to close range. An attacker can let off 15 rounds per second at a target. See for yourself just how handy little guy is. \n\nПолучите 1 FN P90
Mission236=Найдите EVO-3
Mission236Desc=The EVO-3 is a versatile submachine gun that would complete any survivor's outfit. With three separate firing rates to choose from, defending yourself from both the living and dead has never been more enjoyable!\n\nПолучите 1 EVO-3
Mission237=Найдите Bizon
Mission237Desc=Comfortable and easy to carry, the Bizon sub-machine gun has an effective range of roughly 100-200 meters and can fire at a rate of almost 12 shots per second. \n\nПолучите 1 Bizon
Mission238=Найдите Veresk SR-2
Mission238Desc=Since its development in the mid-1990's, the Veresk SR-2 sub-machine gun has an effective range of roughly 100-200 meters and can fire at a rate of almost 12 shots per second. SR-2 is a powerful \n\nПолучите 1 Bizon
Mission239=Найдите FN P90 S
Mission239Desc=Fierce and fast, the FN-P90 S is a silenced version of the standard FN P90. Still the same fire rate, just muzzled and slightly less damage. At the rate of fire it has, \n\nПолучите 1 FN P90
Mission240=Найдите SVD
Mission240Desc=If there's one thing the Russians know, it's guns. The SVD is no exception . Since the introduction of the SVD in the early 60's, Russian infantry squads always had one member of every squad outfitted with an SVD. It is reliable in almost any condition and deadlier than a viper's bite.\n\nПолучите 1 SVD
Mission241=Найдите VSS Vintorez
Mission241Desc="Silence is golden" they say. Well, the VSS Vintorez will send golden whispers to the intended target with an effective range of around 400 meters. \n\nПолучите 1 VSS Vintorez
